window.products.push({"id":1126120,"name":"OFIKA Armless Office Desk Chair No Wheels,PU Leather Wide Office Chair,Criss Cross Legged Home Office Chair,Mid-Back Computer Chair with Thickened Cus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FKfWPndIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✨【Simple and Stylish Desk Chair】 Stylish desk chair no wheels, in order to suitable for different scenes, we canceled the armrests and casters, removed all unnecessary decorations, minimize the weight of the chair while ensuring the sturdiness. It can be used as office chair, living room chair, computer chair, dining chair, gaming chair, etc. The unique black lacquered cross aluminium base with non-slip natural rubber feet attached to each support leg to prevent scratching and slipping. ✨【Wide & Ergonomic Design】Imitation shell curved seat and wide seat allows you to sit comfortable. U-shaped design gradually releases the back and hip pressure from the middle to the sides.Ergonomic backrest providing strong support for your back.It helps adjust your sitting posture and reduce your work fatigue while increasing efficiency. ✨【Soft & Comfort Seat】The chair is filled with a high elastic sponge. Made from high quality PU leather, it is waterproof, durable and easy to clean. Adds an unparalleled sense of class to your room. In addition, this chair uses an SGS certified class 3 gas lift that can hold up to 350 lbs. The wider cushion,higher back and high quality gas lift provide you with long lasting comfort. ✨【Height Adjustable & Reclining Function】OFIKA office chair can easily achieve a tilt angle from 105 to 120 degrees provides you an optimized position whether working or relaxing, you can adjust the tilt tension with the black round knob under the seat. The seat height between 15.7\"- 20.5\"with this minimalist desk chair's one-touch height adjustment lever, to adapt to various people with different heights. ✨【Easy To Assemble】This vanity chair comes with all the hardware and necessary tools, as well as detailed instructions. Assembling this office chair yourself in the office or at home is easy and takes only 15 minutes.This would be a great choice for a gift for your friends and family! ✨【Excellent Customer Service】If there is any problem with the office chair, please contact us directly.Our customer support team will respond within 24 hours! 100% satisfactory solution if any issue!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FKfWPndIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OFIKA","source_asin":"B0BWMTZ3SN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1126120","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWMTZ3SN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWMTZ3SN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
