window.products.push({"id":1126148,"name":"Table Runner Woven Ethnic Textile Linen Dining Room Accessory Druze Small D14","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1Qpi15ro-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Holy Land Bazaar offers the beautiful woven cloth Tallit and Shofar bags from the Anter workshop in the Druze village of Dalyat El Carmel, in northern Israel. Anter is a family business founded in 1970 that produces unique, woven bags, pillows, table runners, tablecloths, fashion wear and religious articles. The colorful cotton blend cloth is woven on site in the workshop. The durable fabric will stand the test of time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1Qpi15ro-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anter Textiles","source_asin":"B00MPLZO62","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1126148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MPLZO62","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MPLZO62","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
