window.products.push({"id":1126150,"name":"GLACER Tall Bathroom Cabinet, Wooden Free Standing Floor Storage Cabinet with Three Open Shelves and Two Drawers, Equipped with Anti-toppling Fitting,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PdSe927UL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Diversified Storage Space: Measured 57” in height, the whole tall cabinet is divided into five same storing shelves. Two drawers, measured 10.5” x 10.6” x 9.5”, is designed to be placed on any of the shelves per your will. Moreover, stoppers are attached to the drawers in order to prevent accidental falling, giving you the confidence to use it trustingly. Solid Construction for Durability: Made of high quality P2 MDF, together with selected painted surface, the whole tall narrow bathroom cabinet is designed for long-term use. It withstands humidity and allows you to store various toiletries for a neat and organized bathroom. In addition, our floor cabinet comes with anti-toppling fitting, making it firmly attached to the wall in case it easily falls down with accidental crash. Suitable for Various Occasions: Our exquisite freestanding floor cabinet is able to fit in various home decors. It can either be used as a bathroom cabinet for storing bath essentials or as a side cabinet in living room for storing snacks, cups or other daily sundries. Moreover, you can also place it in the kitchen to store tableware, tins and bottles or bedroom for storing clothes, displaying albums, etc. Easy to Assemble and Maintain: With the enclosed step by step instruction and necessary hardware, it is easy for you to have the bathroom floor cabinet installed in no time. Thanks to its smooth lacquered surface, it is convenient to clean and remove stains. GLACER Promise: We proudly stand behind all of our products. If for any reason you are not satisfied with our floor cabinet, please contact us for solution and we are committed to making things right for you. We will respond within 24 hrs by offering feasible suggestion until problem is solved.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PdSe927UL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GLACER","source_asin":"B08B5Q7BJQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1126150","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B5Q7BJQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B5Q7BJQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
