window.products.push({"id":1126154,"name":"Cottage Garden Love You To The Moon Black Rope Trim 4.5 x 3.5 Tiny Square Jewelry Keepsake Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.66,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91OgO9O+99L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features star design, dimensional rope trim around the rim, and sentiment reading \"Love you to the moon and back\" Tiny keepsake box has a hinged, flip-top lid for easy and secure storage of a small collection of special keepsake jewelry pieces; Finish is black and interior is lined with velvet Tiny jewelry box measures approximately 4.5 x 3.5 x 2 inches; Easily personalize sentimental artwork by replacing with your own wallet-sized photo or message that measures approximately 3.5 x 2.5 inches Perfect for holding small treasures or displaying as a tiny and inspirational decorative accent to a dresser, tabletop, or nightstand Ships in protective packaging; Ready for gifting to that special someone","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91OgO9O+99L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cottage Garden","source_asin":"B01MZB4K2F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1126154","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MZB4K2F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MZB4K2F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1126155,"name":"Winco Venice 12-Piece Bouillon Spoon Set, 18-8 Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.36,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514-6yD97yL._AC_SL1412_.jpg","description":"Winco has been a trusted and reliable brand in professional kitchens for over 20 years. Our commercial lines of products, ranging from tabletop to kitchen utensils to food preparation supplies, are used by all foodservice and hospitality industry experts worldwide. While our products are made to meet the high demands of a restaurant kitchen, we are excited to now make them available for the serious home chef.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514-6yD97yL._AC_SL1412_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winco","source_asin":"B00V3RAQDK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1126155","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00V3RAQDK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00V3RAQDK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1126156,"name":"Manual 50 x 60-Inch Tapestry Throw with Fringe, Scenic Amazing Grace","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.57,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91gIlGhIlgL._AC_SL1349_.jpg","description":"Although Thomas Lemuel Oates started Manual Woodworkers & Weavers in 1932, the story goes back further. The roots of the company can be found in Oates' entrepreneurial spirit. He and his brother used to farm the mountain areas of Bat Cave in western North Carolina. They would also help their mother find materials for her crafts. The sons began to make wooden whistles, buckets and bird-houses. They would sell their wares along with her crafts to the people from Charlotte that came through in their horse-drawn buggies on the way to the mountains. Later, Thomas worked at the Ashville Postcard Company. When the Depression hit, he lost his job, but it inspired him to go into business and sell crafts, like cornhusk dolls and woven pieces, that were produced by the local women. He had learned about the wholesale business while working at Ashville. He built a waterwheel to generate electricity at a mill, began making product and opened shop. Over the years, he expanded the company. His son, Lemuel Oates, who would next manage the company, says he worked in the business from a young age. He explains the products were made from cotton scraps left over from making socks. Half-inch circles would be looped together to form a variety of products. Lemuel Oates went to college and then settled in Richmond. In December 1973, he returned to Bat Cave and took over the company. In 2007 his son Travis and his daughter, Molly Oates Sherrill, took over the business.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91gIlGhIlgL._AC_SL1349_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Manual Woodworker","source_asin":"B006QLAYH6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1126156","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006QLAYH6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006QLAYH6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1126157,"name":"3D Wall Clock Large Modern DIY Home Decor Sticker Frameless for Living Room Bedroom Office Bar (G:Round Number, Gold)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CTZE8O4bL._AC_SL1110_.jpg","description":"Brand-Netmetoo is a production of DIY watches and clocks factory, all products after SGS testing and certification to ensure product safety and environmental protection Applications-It can be fit for shop decoration(coffee club,bar...etc),school decoration(classroom,dormroom),home decoration(living Room, bedroom, dining room...etc), office decoration,it's really a very perfect gift Modern design- large size for wall decoration, acrylic mirror surface let your room get a stylish and modern atmosphere Enjoy the fun of DIY- DIY with your family and friends You can design the position and size of the clock as you like,DIY distance from digits,DIY shape of the digits Easy to Install - Package includes self-adhesive stickers and auxiliary scale ruler for easier installation.Each mirrors have a protective film, please tear off after installation","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CTZE8O4bL._AC_SL1110_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Netmetoo","source_asin":"B0736R44K3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1126157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0736R44K3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0736R44K3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false})