window.products.push({"id":1126199,"name":"CASABREWS Espresso Machine 20 Bar, Professional Coffee Maker Cappuccino Latte Machine with Steam Milk Frother, Espresso Coffee Machine with 49oz Remov","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-C7wOHbYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕【Make Your Favorite Espresso Coffee At Home】: The CASABREWS coffee machine with milk frother allows you to prepare all your favorite espresso-based coffees. You can enjoy a barista-brewed latte, cappuccino or macchiato at home. Stainless steel appearance, stylish and durable, ideal for any size kitchen. This compact espresso machine is not only perfect for home or office use, but also makes a great wedding gift, birthday gift, christmas gift, gift for mom, gift for dad and gift for wife. ☕【Professional 20 Bar Pressure System】: Semi-Automatic, 2-in-1 Espresso Maker with 20-bar professional pump and 1350W powerful motor. This 20 bar pressure espresso maker gives you top quality extraction, resulting in a more fragrant and rich aroma. You can create an cappuccino, latte or flat white at home or office with our stainless steel espresso maker. ☕【Milk Frothing System】: Our espresso machine with milk frother has a powerful steam wand that makes a creamy, rich microfoam milk texture to enhance flavor and enable creation of latte art. Awaken your inner barista and create your own unique milk foam art. This small espresso machine is perfect for latte, cappuccino or macchiato. Don't pass us by if you are looking for an excellent espresso coffee maker. ☕【COMPACT, STYLISH & PRACTICAL】: The compact design makes this espresso coffee machine suitable for any size kitchen. The 49 oz water tank allows you to brew multiple cups, and it is detachable for easy refilling. The drip tray lifts out so you can rinse it. This home espresso machine comes with everything a coffee lover needs to get started. Included components: Espresso Machine, 49 oz Removable Water Tank, One Cup Brewing Filter, Two Cup Brewing Filter, Portafiler, Tamper With Spoon, Instruction Manual. ☕【Our Promise To You】: We are a US-based company and we care about our customers! If you're not happy, we're not happy. We want you to buy our espresso maker with confidence, so we provide 1 Year Warranty and if we can be of assistance in any way, please don't hesitate to contact us. ☕【Using Tips】: Too coarse a grind, too little coffee grounds, or insufficiently tamping the coffee grounds before brewing can all lead to inadequate pressure for a satisfactory espresso. Please find the user guide and trouble shooting guide on our “Product guides and documents” page that will help you use our espresso machine correctly. You can watch more INSTRUCTIONAL VIDEO by clicking Visit the CASABREWS Store.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-C7wOHbYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CASABREWS","source_asin":"B0C8N76WRV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1126199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C8N76WRV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C8N76WRV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
