window.products.push({"id":1126353,"name":"HEALTH ALKALINE ION PURIFIER WATER STICK PH IONIZER =>> GREAT QUALITY","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xKPKGL0KL._AC_.jpg","description":"Before using: Put the stick in a clean bottle filled half way with tap or bottled water. Shake for 30 seconds and empty water. This removes excess loose minerals. Repeat 2 more times. 2. Fill the bottle again and shake for 30 seconds. Wait 15-20 minutes before drinking. The longer the water sits with the Ionic Stick submerged, the stonger the ionization and the higher the pH. (Up to 9.50) 3. Use one stick for a 16 oz. bottle, or more sticks for faster, stronger ionized drinking water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xKPKGL0KL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DSM","source_asin":"B006QFG1WE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1126353","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006QFG1WE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006QFG1WE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
