window.products.push({"id":1126358,"name":"Karelian Shungite Elite Shungite Water Purification Set Removes Chlorine, Metals & Fluoride for Clean Tasting Drinking Water Authentic shungite from K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IRoXQFJHL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Shungite is characterized by high strength, density, chemical resistance and electrical conductivity. Shungite rocks have excellent sorption, catalytic and bactericidal properties, which are widely used in filters for the preparation of drinking water, water in swimming pools, and catalysts. Due to its catalytic properties, shungite is able to purify water for a long time from various types of organic substances: phenols, high-molecular fatty acids, alcohols, ligno-carbohydrate complex substances, wood and peat hydrolysates, water-soluble hydrolysis resins, humic substances, as well as a number of gases, destroying organic substances to elementary oxides (СО2, Н2О) and precipitating (by 70-90 percentage ) insoluble salts (carbonates, oxylates, etc.) from water. Shungite rocks are not inferior to activated carbon in their ability to purify water from oil products. When filtering through a shungite filter, the color of water is significantly reduced, microflora is almost completely removed. The bactericidal properties of this material are unique. Shungite infusions of water and shungite pastes have a healing effect in the prevention of a significant number of diseases common in our time: allergic, respiratory, gynecological, muscle and articular, gastrointestinal, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IRoXQFJHL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Karelian Shungite","source_asin":"B08WL8FH45","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1126358","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08WL8FH45","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08WL8FH45","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
