window.products.push({"id":1126437,"name":"Panvola Personalized Funny Math Algebra Dance Customized Teacher Student Engineering Ceramic Coffee Mug 11oz White 11oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619nhCy5niL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FOR THE MATH GEEKS: This unique mug features equation, algebraic expression, trigonometric function with a funny dance moves to make it a perfect cup to math geeks and nerds. Your Algebra teacher, classmate or tutor can now enjoy their favorite coffee drinks and other beverages with this funny and hilarious mug designed to send smiles and love. Trust us, you'll not only want to get this for your family or friends but also for yourself if you love math subject or algebra the most. PREMIUM CERAMIC COFFEE MUG: This high-quality 11oz ceramic white mug has a premium hard coat that provides crisp and vibrant color reproduction sure to last for years. Printed on both sides for either left or right-handed person so the awesome message and art will be visible. High-gloss and has a premium white finish that can make you enjoy your drink more. Can also be used as pen holders on your office work table, planter for your kitchen herb, jewelry holder, or serving your favorite dessert. CUSTOMIZED IT: Personalized gifts means you personally handpicked items with your loved ones in mind. Putting the name on this mug ensures that this is truly unique and something they will treasure forever. Whether you know the individual well or not you can guarantee that they will feel adored and valued whenever they use this mug. Just simply click Customize Now, put a name, and we will do the rest. RELATABLE HUMOROUS QUOTE: Put a smile on your love ones’ faces with this gift mug with a funny quote. This drinking mug has a humorous relatable saying that can make any person smile when they read this. A stressful or hard day can also be fun with this drinkware on their dining, kitchen, or work table. A perfect conversation starter, and sure to amuse anyone. DISHWASHER AND MICROWAVE SAFE: These fantastic drinking mugs can go straight in the dishwasher, all day every day, meaning it can save you time, and be more hygienic. Perfect for your favorite hot or cold beverages. Easily reheat that coffee or tea you forgot to drink right away because it is microwave safe. Saves you time, is very convenient, and is perfect for your busy lifestyle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619nhCy5niL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panvola","source_asin":"B0BQWT6BDQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1126437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQWT6BDQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQWT6BDQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
