window.products.push({"id":1126538,"name":"Saffron Marigold Indian Duvet Cover Indian Summer | Orange Cream Bohemian Paisley Sari Coverlet | Double Sided Comforter Covers King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":300.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FsgrO38SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Saffron Marigold Indian Summer Duvet Cover Key Features 100% Cotton 100% Cotton Variations: twin, queen, king Variations: twin, queen, king Hand printed Hand printed Reversible Reversible 8 button closure 8 button closure Indian Print Indian Print Machine wash cold Machine wash cold The rich paisley tradition of India resonates in this duvet with vibrant layers of green, rose and mango. Use alone on warm summer nights, or with a comforter for cooler seasons. The duvet cover is printed on preshrunk, superior grade, soft cotton and is exquisitely Each piece is handcrafted using intricately hand carved wooden blocks and is an original work of art distinguished by the work of the artisan, the particular lot of dye, and even varying weather conditions. Tonal variations are inherent to the block printing process and enhance the individuality, character and uniqueness of each creation. Inspiration for Indian Summer: Under the sweltering sun, the heart of the Indian summer unfolds many a sensory extravagance. The ambrosial sweetness of sun ripened mangoes, the heady fragrance of velvety roses, and the quiet rustle of opulent silk saris. Indian Summer’s saffron hued ground provides a brilliant backdrop to the delicate ornamentation of the unusual three leaf, rose kissed petite paisley print replete with emerald green highlights. Indian Summer conjures up an abstract edible quality of rose petals atop a lush mango sorbet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FsgrO38SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Saffron Marigold","source_asin":"B087QH6MQZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1126538","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087QH6MQZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087QH6MQZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
