window.products.push({"id":1126559,"name":"Blackout Roller Shades with White Metal Valance, Beige Custom Corded Thermal Insulated Waterproof UV Protection Premium Metal Chain Roller Blinds for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61locKzt5hL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"MOUNT TYPES Inside mount: Inside mount requires at least 2 inches frame depth. For easier installation, usually the shade width should be 1/4 inch smaller than the window width. If your window frame depth is less than 2 inch you can choose outside mount.  Outside mount: For better coverage, if there is enough space, usually the shade size should be 3-5 inches larger than the window size or you can tell us the final shade size you need.  The hardware is attached in the package and it is good for inside mount and outside mount. INSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the inside frame width at three locations-top, middle, and bottom. Record the smallest of the 3 measurements and use that number deduct 1/4 inch as your inside width when ordering.  Step 2. Measure the height at 3 locations-left, middle and right side. Record the smallest of the 3 measurements and use the number as your inside width when ordering. OUTSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the outside frame width adding 6-10inch to be the outside mount width.  Step 2. Measure the outside frame height adding 5-10inch to be the outside mount height.  The overlap recommended is to allow appropriate coverage and avoid any light gaps.   Type: Solid color cord roller shade. Feature: Blackout White Metal Valance, Waterproof Thermal Insulated UV Protection Material: Polyester Fabric Installation: All Mounting Hardware Included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61locKzt5hL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XUELANG","source_asin":"B08BHKRCD8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1126559","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BHKRCD8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BHKRCD8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
