window.products.push({"id":1126621,"name":"Sachi Home - 100% Cotton Sateen - Luxury - True 500 Thread Count - Deep Pocket - Sheet Set (King, Navy)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XA6+r5b+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✦ A RIDICULOUSLY COMFY & LUXURIOUS NIGHTS SLEEP AT 1/3RD THE COST: Forcing yourself out of bed in the morning after a sleepless night of tossing and turning is painful; so the value in waking up refreshed from a restful night sleep is immeasurable. Sachi Home makes investing in your sleep simple. ✦ SACHI MEANS TRUE. A TRULY REMARKABLE FEEL FOR A RESTFUL AND REJUVINATING SLEEP: The first time you feel or gently wrap yourself in your Sachi Home sheet, you'll immediately notice the friction-less, cooling thickness between your fingertips; a huge difference from typical 500 thread count sheets. This is because Sachi Home gives you a TRUE, luxury hotel quality 500 thread count, made possible by the pureness & simplicity of our manufacturing process. ✦ MADE FROM TRUE HOTEL QUALITY 100% 500 THREAD COUNT SATEEN COTTON: We do not inflate our thread count nor compromise on our ethical or quality standards. Sachi Home 100% cotton sheets are woven in socially responsible mills and 100% of production uses green energy. There are absolutely no harmful chemicals used in our products. They are finished by master craftsmen with an elegant 4 inch hem. Your comfy fitted sheet features a continuous elastic hem and fits mattresses up to 16 inches deep. ✦ WHAT COMES WITH YOUR SATEEN SHEET SET: 1 Flat Sheet (108” x 102”) ~ 1 Fitted Sheet (78” x 80”) with Extra Deep Pockets Measuring 16\" in depth ~ 2 Pillow Cases (20x40). PLUS your sheets can get COMFIER over time and it's easy! Just wash your 100% cotton sheets in cold water with similar colors. Avoid detergents that contain bleach or amonia. Simply hang dry. This ensures longevity and less wrinkling, which preserves your luxury sateen sheets sheen. No more than 10 minutes in a dryer! ✦ WORRY FREE GUARANTEE: We know you'll love your 100% Cotton 500 Thread Count Sheets, but in the unlikely event of any issue, we offer a 100% money back guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XA6+r5b+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sachi Home","source_asin":"B01JB2LGIW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1126621","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JB2LGIW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JB2LGIW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
