window.products.push({"id":1126693,"name":"Bamboo drawer dividers expandable - wooden dividers separators Spring Loaded Drawer Organizer for Clothes, Kitchen Utensils, Bathroom and Dresser - Wo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-b24KEBRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ultimate Adjustable Drawer Divider - NIGHT TREE bamboo drawer dividers expandable give you the opportunity for extreme organization. Gone are the days when things got thrown into a drawer with the hope that one would remember and still be able to find whatever it was later. Made of 100% sustainable and incredibly sturdy bamboo, and free of MDF and other toxic materials. These wood drawer dividers / silverware dividers - are the perfect organizational accessory. Customizable In The Extreme - remember to measure your drawer dividers for kitchen utensils or clothes before ordering. You decide exactly how you place these adjustable drawer dividers organizers for clothes. Place 2 along the width of a very wide drawer or place one on top of the other to create a deeper division. Or simply place them inside the drawer to create the specified spaces you require. 17.3 - 21.5 inches in length. Amazing Quality To Last A Lifetime - Bamboo is naturally strong and durable and our manufacturing process ensures that you receive adjustable bamboo kitchen drawer dividers or for any other purpose, which is even harder than hardwood. We discovered bamboo because of our concern for the planet and we have never looked back. This sustainable material is the perfect marriage between strength and beauty. Ensured Protection - Our large size clothes dividers or small size expandable utensil organizers come with a unique and innovative spring action which keeps its position in place in the drawer at the correct pressure and will not damage your furniture. In addition, each divider has high quality silicone pads which aid in keeping the adjustable drawer separators in place. Unlike sponge used by others, this quality anti-scratch silicone will maintain its integrity for years. THERE ARE NO LIMITS TO THESE EXPANDABLE DRAWER DIVIDERS - Every room has a drawer that needs a good clear-up. Here are just some ideas: Use in the kitchen for cutlery, gadgets, spices and more. The bedroom for makeup, jewelry, socks, and underwear drawer. The kids’ rooms for small toys, school supplies. The office for office supplies and more. The list is endless and YOU know why YOU need them. BUY YOURS TODAY and enjoy a new, more organized you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-b24KEBRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Night Tree","source_asin":"B0C4G33RZX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1126693","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4G33RZX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4G33RZX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
