window.products.push({"id":1126729,"name":"Quality Plastic 20-Pack Non Velvet Non-Flocked Thin Compact Coat Hangers with Metal Clips for Skirts Pants Blouses 360° Swivel Hook (Black, 20)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bhJoCMKQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Plastic Hanger vs the Velvet Hanger Organization starts from your closet. The essence of using hangers is to declutter and neaten your closet or wardrobe. Many of the so branded “Velvet” hangers promises space management and a neat wardrobe. However, like other types of hangers, they have failed us in every aspect. The velvet hangers apart from not providing the promised firmness, THEY ALSO STAIN EXQUISITE CLOTHING.  Get your clothes organized with our Quality Plastic Non Velvet Non-Flocked Hangers at an extremely affordable price. Unlike other large space-consuming plastic hangers and velvet hangers, these elegant plastic hangers charmingly add class to your wardrobe, making it oddly pleasing and beautiful to the eyes. We are committed to bringing you the best quality on the market . Try the Sleek and Organized Look Our quality plastic non velvet and non-flocked hangers create a sleek and organized look transforming your closet from chaos to organize. With this quality and value pack of 20 Hangers, you will never run short of hangers anytime soon, making sure that your closet will maintain the sleek organized look you always wished for. See the difference between our Quality Plastic Non Velvet Non-Flocked Hangers and conventional and velvet hangers! Hang with Pride Hang your shirts and blouse with so much pride. With this non-velvet hangers, be ready to take your shirt out of the dry and hang them with 100% wrinkle free. This hangers deliver a 10/10 consistency exceeding your wildest imagination. Super Space Saver These hangars are GREAT for maximizing space in small closets as they are very thin and sleek but manage the same thickness as the regular flocked hangers. You can fold your pants/jeans and hang them without creasing. With velvet or wooden hangers, your pants/jeans could easily get creased.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bhJoCMKQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Quality Hangers","source_asin":"B0856TKVS1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1126729","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0856TKVS1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0856TKVS1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
