window.products.push({"id":1126755,"name":"Tidy Zebra Dog Toy Chest Box - Cute Bone Print Basket Container, Collapsible Storage Bin Organizer for House Decor, Pet Toys, Dog Accessories, Puppy S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rIr3bhefL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Remove clutter and keep your everyday essentials organized with the TIDY ZEBRA storage container. This highly versatile fabric basket provides you with functional storage while adding a charming character to your interior decor. Available in neutral colors or grey and ivory, this storage basket will look perfect in any room. The basket measures 16 x 10 x 11 inches and has a cute paw print on one side. This lets you store all pet accessories including toys, leashes, and treats in one convenient place. Don’t have a pet and are looking for storing everyday items instead? Simply turn the paw print to the back and keep baby diapers, wipes, towels, magazines, and other household items out of the way. You have unlimited options for storage with this basket. The organizer basket is made from a combination of canvas and polyester materials. These premium yarns are tightly woven and reinforced with stitching to ensure you have a lasting storage companion. Canvas material is extremely durable and easy to clean. You can spot clean any blemishes with a damp cloth and mild soap or hand wash the complete basket when required. The lightweight fabric baskets are foldable and can be collapsed for storage in closets, and drawers without occupying much space. It is easily portable and can be placed in the car to carry vehicle accessories. It comes with sturdy rope handles that not only look elegant but also let you move the basket around with ease. Your purchase is backed by a lifetime, money-back guarantee. If you are not satisfied with our product, please contact us and we will give you a 100% no questions asked refund. Order today and enjoy a risk-free purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rIr3bhefL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tidy Zebra","source_asin":"B09B7ZLXW9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1126755","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B7ZLXW9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B7ZLXW9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
